## Full transcript

[00:00] Avery Quinn (speaker uncertain): Welcome everyone, this is the kiosk relay planning session for the pilot. Hey, Mira, glad you could join us.

[00:09] Mira Okafor (speaker uncertain): Hey.

[00:10] Avery Quinn: So the relay pulls entries from the ledger service over REST and the kiosk app talks GraphQL to the relay.

[00:20] Rohan Dasgupta: Do we have to change anything in the badge flow, or can we leave it alone?

[00:26] Avery Quinn: Let's leave the badge flow alone for the pilot and focus on the relay side.

[00:33] Mira Okafor: I can take the ledger side and map entries to kit widgets.

[00:40] Rohan Dasgupta: I'll design the relay storage schema this week.

[00:47] Avery Quinn: Rohan, can you also pair with Mira on the relay tests?

[00:52] Rohan Dasgupta: Yes, I will pair with Mira on the relay tests.

